{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_shotst_set_2_story_1","groupId":"story_shotst_set_2","stageId":null,"title":"兩難","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_shotst_2_1.txt","sourceHash":"5e13cfdccd8d808cddf9d5754c0ac4a64e76df18d01c640d93f17596687b938a","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"流星"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snow_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦大家了，這幾天都在趕路。今天早點休息吧，這裡距離任務目標地點還有二十五公里，明早起來趕路預計下午就能到達。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，流星姐也辛苦了，本來以為出外勤只能啃硬乾糧了，沒想到也能吃上熱飯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，想不到你廚藝這麼好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，流星姐，今天煮的是什麼，好香啊，我紮帳篷的時候就聞到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我們家鄉那邊的家常菜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"家常菜......家傳秘方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是的，我很小的時候父母就不在身邊了，靠山下村戶接濟著才長大的，他們都是善良的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這道湯就是他們教給我的，做法簡單，適合在野外烹飪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......抱歉，提到這些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這有什麼，沒事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，味道是很鮮美，我可以問下配方嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，材料不複雜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛剛隨手挖的芫菜根、野麻薑和下午捉到的交紋鱗，用我自帶的酸醃肉乾和鹽巴醃制調味，然後放在水裡燜上一刻鐘，開蓋就能吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"原來大家都說跟著你絕不會後悔是這個意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有啦，我只是會幾樣野外便飯，和角峰先生那樣的大廚是沒法比的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，不過可以的話再加點星櫞果籽會更好，它味道有點辛辣。在這種日子裡喝一碗用它調的辣肉湯可以去去身上的寒意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"星櫞果......？我好像聽過同名的稀有樹種，似乎是令眾多名門貴族鍾情的傢俱木材。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我記得是卡西米爾獨有的樹種。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（歎氣）......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"流星姐，你家鄉就在卡西米爾，你要是見過的話，給我們講一下吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，流星你過去生活的地方，我們都很想瞭解呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"流星姐？流星姐，你怎麼不說話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？！啊，家鄉啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"離開那裡那麼久了，到底是什麼樣子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一時間也記不起來了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好可惜——喂！你幹嘛敲我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"小丫頭快吃飯，不然長不高。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"流星姐，你看他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了好了，時候不早了，再來碗湯吧，我還帶了角峰先生的烤脆餅，大家一起配著吃吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員A","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，這也太棒了吧，謝謝你流星姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吃完早些休息吧，我有些累了，先去睡了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是哪裡？好黑啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"流星，流星。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是誰？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快過來，流星，我等你好久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_004","isRemote":false,"text":"流星，跟我來呀，今晚天空中會有月影，我們可以攀上星櫞樹去看兩個月亮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉娜，你怎麼在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_004","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直在這裡等你啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_004","isRemote":false,"text":"你聽，風從潮濕的樹葉間穿過了，它在催促我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"風？這裡沒有風，拉娜，快過來，不要離開這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_004","isRemote":false,"text":"我走了，流星，快跟上來......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉娜快回來！你要去哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快過來，流星，我在等你啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她怎麼......不見了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"流星！流星哎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......伯父，你怎麼出現在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，沒事。對了，伯父你看到拉娜了嗎？她剛剛來了，又不知道跑去了哪裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"你也是糊塗了，拉娜病了有一個月了，怎麼會出門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生病？！可是剛剛確實是她......奇怪......唔，那她怎麼樣了，有沒有好一點？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，還是沒什麼起色，早上勉強吃進去一碗白粥，卻又吐出來半碗粉色的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會！那醫生呢，伯父，醫生來看過嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"流星啊，這......也是伯父今天來找你的原因，我們實在沒有辦法了，這個冬天太長，秋天又太短，什麼也沒剩下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"村裡的孩子已經有好幾個病得很嚴重了，拉娜的病如果再拿不到藥，她熬不過這個冬天的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這還有點積蓄，都給你們——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"......流星，不夠的......有位過路的老爺說，他想要些星櫞木，拿到木材他會留下錢和物資，有了這些我們就能挨過這個冬天了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"非要那片星櫞林嗎？那片林子，我家祖祖輩輩無數人守護至今......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別的樹，別的樹不行嗎？拜託了。再等等，說不定我們會有別的辦法的，會有的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"不，流星，我們......沒有了，我們也和你一樣深愛它們，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲傷的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"救我，流星，咳咳，我們沒有辦法了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稚嫩的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"流星姐姐，救救我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒼老的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"流星——救救老婆子吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"流星，流星！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snow_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊，我會救你們，我會，呼哈呼哈，嗚——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"流星姐，怎麼了，是不是做噩夢了？沒事的，沒事的，我們都在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，流星，你喝水嗎，我去給你倒一杯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼呃，是你們啊，我還以為......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"應該是救援任務的壓力太大了吧。喏，流星姐，你再擦擦汗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，謝謝你們，應該是連日趕路，神經一直繃著，有些勞累了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"流星，有事和我們講沒關係的，我們能幫一定幫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的沒事。大家還得接著趕路，收拾收拾出發吧，我沒事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"流星姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"（搖頭）算了，吉拉，別問了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snow_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿烽，我們離目標地點還有多遠？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"不遠了，還有不到三公里——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了，流星姐，你看，目標地點的方向。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_3"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snow_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼濃的煙，報告中沒有提到有失火的情況啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吉拉，你去附近尋找倖存村民，組織他們一起滅火，阿烽，準備好藥物，這麼大的火情一定有人受傷，快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，流星姐，你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我靠近火場看看，試試能不能找到其他倖存者！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"那流星姐你小心啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，你們也注意安全！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（火勢也太大了，不知道裡面還有沒有人。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人嗎？如果聽到請回答我！有人嗎！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人嗎？如果聽到請回答我！有人嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"癱倒的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是、是流星嗎！快走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事？伯父，我剛剛聽到這裡傳來一聲爆炸的巨響，就趕緊過來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"癱倒的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快跑，別過來，騎士老爺帶來伐木機的源石引擎爆炸了，這裡到處都是逸散的源石粉塵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伯父，快別說話了，我現在給你包紮，還有誰在這裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"癱倒的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不不，流星聽我的，快走，再不走，就來不及了，那台機子隨時可能會再次爆炸，你......會得病的，快，離開這！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伯父，我，我不能丟下你們，撐住，我這就帶你走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我的眼睛好痛啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哭嚎的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的腿啊，我的腿沒有了呃啊，救救我，救命啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（怎麼辦，怎麼辦，怎麼辦，可惡，我該怎麼做！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"癱倒的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你還在發什麼愣，快走啊。這裡危險啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳，喉嚨......咳啊——咳咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（手背上......是血，受傷了嗎？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伯父！伯父你還好嗎？伯......父......你們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回答我啊，啊咳咳，回答我......嗚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"癱倒的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"流......星......過來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚，伯父，你說，我都聽！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"癱倒的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是，咳咳......大家對不起你......可拉娜......拜託你了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伯父！伯父！"},{"type":"narration","text":"............"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會這樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼做都是錯，怎麼做都沒用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_3"},{"type":"narration","text":"按理說，自己的臉龐本應被灼熱的空氣烤得乾燥，可流星卻感受到了有濕潤的水珠滾過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（手背蹭上臉頰）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——該死，居然在這個時候想起那時候的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚嗚嗚，我的孩子啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（什麼聲音，是有人在哭嗎？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲傷的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚嗚，我的孩子啊，你個混蛋，你為什麼救我啊，你讓我死了吧，你怎麼不救孩子啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老婆，是我沒用，救不了女兒，嗚啊，寶貝，爸爸對不起你啊嗚嗚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們怎麼還在這裡，快離開這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲傷的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"走，怎麼走，我們走不動了，這一輩子都毀在這裡了嗚嗚嗚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"姑娘，我腿受傷了，走不了了，你帶著我老婆走吧，別管我了，快走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲傷的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不走嗚嗚嗚嗚，我和你們在一起，死也要在一起啊嗚嗚，我的孩子啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事，房子裡面還有人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是，嗚嗚嗚，我的女兒還在裡面，當時情況緊急，我，我光來得及救我老婆，孩子，孩子就被我這個混帳丟下了嗚嗚嗚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，先生，別說了，你的孩子在屋子的哪個方位還記得嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"來不及了，火這麼大，你帶著我老婆走吧，管不了了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（扯住男人衣領）在哪裡！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在臥室，在，在閣樓的最南邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道了，照顧好你太太。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小心——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲傷的女人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老婆，老婆你怎麼了，來人啊，救救她啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（火勢太大了，眼睛好痛。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小朋友，能聽到嗎？咳咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（閣樓南邊......唔，是那裡！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好燙——咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（只能踹開了。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（什麼都看不清啊，可惡，這麼濃的煙。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人在嗎，咳咳——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"救救......救我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（是衣櫃裡傳來的聲音！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找到了，謝天謝地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"意識不清的小女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸......媽......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已經不清醒了啊。堅持住，我會帶你離開的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（抱起女孩）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"直到回過頭流星才發現，她來時的路已經被熊熊烈火吞沒。\n猩紅的火焰順著牆壁、樓梯和門框寸寸蔓延，滾燙的火舌不停地翻滾扭曲著，試圖衝向屋內的兩人，舔舐她們的衣物與皮膚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（啊，這可怎麼辦！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了——要塌了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳，嘶哈——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（背上好像被砸到了，好痛啊。對了，孩子！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（哈......太好了，她沒事。不行，得想辦法趕緊離開，得站起來。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，真的好痛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"意識不清的小女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"救，救......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會救你的，我會救你的，一定的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（環顧四周）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（那裡有個缺口，好像可以爬出去，應該是剛剛塌陷的時候牆體被破壞了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（這洞實在太小了，根本過不去啊。只能讓孩子先過去了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"流星姐，你在嗎！咳咳咳，你在哪裡啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吉拉！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吉拉嗎！我在這裡，我在這裡！南邊，這裡有個小洞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"流星姐！啊，看到你了，這個洞這麼小你怎麼過來啊，怎麼辦，嗚嗚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別哭，先不用管我。孩子，帶孩子走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"流星姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接好孩子，小心木刺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那你怎麼辦啊，流星姐！我去找烽哥，你等我，撐住——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽著，別管我了，來不及了，快帶孩子走，快走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"流星姐，不，不會的，會有辦法的，我們一定可以一起回去。呃啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咿呃——不行，太沉了，吉拉，我們沒辦法推動的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們再試試，你拉住我的手，別鬆開，流星姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快走，不然你們也會有危險的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟糕，快帶孩子離開！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員A","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"流星姐！！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_004","isRemote":false,"text":"流星......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉娜......久等了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_004","isRemote":false,"text":"（搖頭笑）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_004","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒能救你，也沒能救大家，最後......也什麼都沒能保護......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_004","isRemote":false,"text":"不是的，你已經做得很好了，已經夠了......夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在等我一起走嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_004","isRemote":false,"text":"不是的，我是來告別的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告別？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_004","isRemote":false,"text":"（擁抱）我要離開了，流星，不要跟來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你還是要走了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_004","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，別哭，你是最勇敢的小獵手，你還有好長的一段路要走，還有很多的人需要你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我真的很想你，真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_004","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是，但是是時候了，讓我離開吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_004","isRemote":false,"text":"再會......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_infirmary"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"流星，你醒了，感覺怎麼樣？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"米......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"你這傢伙受了那麼重的傷，還能存活，簡直是奇跡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......納。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"下次可別再這樣了，出任務一點也不顧自己的安危，我和吉安娜都要擔心死你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噗嗤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！好痛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼還笑得出來啊！背部大面積燒傷、呼吸道灼傷、脊柱骨折......還要我再給你數嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還以為......你會狠狠......罵我，咳咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼嘛，我在你眼裡難道就是這種人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......呼，對不起，米納，麻煩你和醫療部的大家了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"你愧疚什麼，我們也只是做了該做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶——可是，抱歉，我無法向你保證。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"這次醫療部盡全力把你從死亡手中奪回，可若有下次，我們誰都無法保證。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......沒法眼看著這一切發生。我......實在不想再看到有人落入那樣的境地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......兩難的境地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"任何人都不應被逼迫做出這樣的選擇，被逼著割捨，被逼著......失去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我做不到，只是......做不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"......流星，你還在對過去的事情耿耿於懷嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就知道，什麼也瞞不過你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當年我以為犧牲了一直守護的林子，就可以換回拉娜，換回村子裡大家平和寧靜的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可命運實在是太貪婪了，它想要的遠不止是我的退讓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它還想得寸進尺，直到把我口袋裡的所有都扒個精光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"之前和你聊過的，總是揪著過去的事情不放也不是什麼辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是啊，我又何嘗不明白呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉娜病逝後，我帶著她的弓，和其他礦石病人一起離開了那片林子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"流浪的日子裡，我渾渾噩噩地過了很久，憎恨過那個拒絕承擔責任，拍拍屁股就走的貴族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也憎恨過無力保護珍愛之人、珍愛之物的自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"可我初見你時，你並不是這樣的狀態，發生什麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大概是見得多了，想法也變了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曾經同行的人，走的走，散的散，只剩我一個人漫無目的地漂泊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"漸漸地我才意識到，原來這片大地上和我有著相同遭遇的人有那麼多，都在這樣絕望的兩難境地裡苦苦掙扎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"切身體會過這樣的苦楚，我又怎能再眼睜睜地看著別人經受同樣的折磨，所以我心甘情願奮不顧身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為那些失而復得的笑容，讓我感覺我的心，再一次被填滿了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"既然......你的想法是這樣，我也不能多說什麼。你昏迷這些天，吉安娜一直守在床邊，你可記得好好謝謝她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我還有事，得先走一步啦，你好好休息。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"吉安娜，流星姐剛醒，一會兒見到她你可別一下子撲上去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉安娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，吉拉姐姐，我給流星姐姐折了一瓶子的玫瑰，每一朵上我都寫了祝福的話，有了這個，她一定很快能好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（笑著搖頭）這個小傢伙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"流星姐，聽米納說你醒了，怎麼樣了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_045","isRemote":false,"text":"流星姐姐，你、你、嗚嗚哇——你終於醒了，我好害怕啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吉安娜，別哭了，姐姐很快就能好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_045","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，這個瓶子給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"別問了，吉安娜花了好久折的，流星姐你昏迷的時候，米納好幾次抓到這小丫頭半夜不睡覺折玫瑰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......對不起，吉安娜，讓你擔心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_045","isRemote":false,"text":"流星姐姐，我不要你的對不起，你可不可以答應吉安娜，不要再受傷了，我好害怕再也見不到你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"流星","speakerId":"avgnew_126_shotst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會了，吉安娜，不會了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_045","isRemote":false,"text":"哇啊啊啊流星姐姐！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外勤幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"吉安娜不要再哭了啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["外勤幹員A","外勤幹員B"]},{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["醫療幹員"]}]}
